  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Emp 101.10 “Not immediately available” means based on the current labor market the claimant is not likely to successfully obtain such work in 27 or fewer calendar days.\n\nSource. #10193, INTERIM, eff 10-1-12, EXPIRED: 4-1-13\n\nNew. #10329-A, eff 5-7-13",
